      "position": {
        "x": 260,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-director",
        "userInputTemplate": "输出本集唯一生产简报与岗位任务。总时长可以大于 6 秒；在交付规格中明确下游单镜生成时长上限为 6 秒，但不要把计划写成已生成成品。\n【项目设定】\n{{start.projectBrief}}\n【本集需求】\n{{start.episodeBrief}}\n【总时长】{{start.durationSeconds}} 秒\n【画幅】{{start.aspectRatio}}\n【额外要求】{{start.requirements}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"production_brief\",\"tasks\",\"asset_status\",\"quality_gates\",\"next_action\"],\"properties\":{\"production_brief\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"goal\",\"delivery_spec\",\"assumptions\",\"blockers\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"goal\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"delivery_spec\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"assumptions\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"blockers\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}},\"tasks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"asset_status\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"quality_gates\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"next_action\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}"
