        "userInputTemplate": "只建立本集实际使用场景的场景 ID、空间布局、地标、行动区和光照。场景必须支持剧本动作，不得引入其他项目的专名或地点。\n【项目设定】\n{{start.projectBrief}}\n【剧本】\n{{writer.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scene_bible\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_bible\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"scenes\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"scenes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scene_id\",\"name\",\"version\",\"layout\",\"lighting\",\"camera_positions\",\"continuity_rules\",\"generation_description\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"version\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"lighting\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"camera_positions\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"continuity_rules\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"generation_description\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "storyboard",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "独立分镜",
      "position": {
        "x": 980,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-storyboard",
        "userInputTemplate": "将剧本转换为连续镜头。每镜绑定 beat_id、角色版本和场景 ID，明确起止状态、景别、构图、主体动作、摄影机运动和连续性检查；当前视频生成链要求单镜不得超过 6 秒，超出时拆镜且保持总时长。\n【剧本】\n{{writer.output}}\n【人物设定】\n{{char_design.output}}\n【场景设定】\n{{scene_design.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"storyboard\"],\"properties\":{\"storyboard\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"aspect_ratio\",\"total_duration_sec\",\"shots\",\"duration_check\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"aspect_ratio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"total_duration_sec\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0},\"shots\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"shot_id\",\"scene_id\",\"beat_id\",\"duration_sec\",\"shot_size\",\"composition\",\"subject_action\",\"camera_motion\",\"start_state\",\"end_state\",\"character_refs\",\"scene_ref\",\"continuity_checks\"],\"properties\":{\"shot_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"scene_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"beat_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"duration_sec\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0,\"maximum\":6},\"shot_size\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"composition\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"subject_action\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"camera_motion\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_state\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"end_state\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"character_refs\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"scene_ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"continuity_checks\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}},\"duration_check\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
