      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-prompt-engineer",
        "userInputTemplate": "把通过门禁的分镜、动作特效包和真实关键帧 URL 编译成逐镜视频生成包。每条参数 duration 为 1-6 秒，绑定唯一 shot_id、目标模型和真实引用；不得输出整集一次生成的合并提示词，也不得声称视频已生成。\n【规格包】\n{{spec_package.output}}\n【图片资产】\n{{image_package.output}}\n【图片 QA】\n{{image_qa.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"video_prompt_package\"],\"properties\":{\"video_prompt_package\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"shots\",\"global_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"shots\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"shot_id\",\"target_model_id\",\"prompt\",\"reference_map\",\"parameters\",\"continuity_in\",\"continuity_out\",\"validation\"],\"properties\":{\"shot_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"target_model_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"prompt\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reference_map\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"duration\",\"resolution\",\"aspect_ratio\",\"image_url\",\"generate_audio\"],\"properties\":{\"duration\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0,\"maximum\":6},\"resolution\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"aspect_ratio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"image_url\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"generate_audio\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}}},\"continuity_in\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"continuity_out\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"validation\":{\"type\":\"object\"}}}},\"global_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "video_tasks",
      "type": "code",
      "name": "视频任务拆分",
      "position": {
        "x": 3680,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "expression": "package.get(\"shots\",[])",
        "inputs": {
          "package": "{{video_prompt.video_prompt_package}}"
        },
        "onError": "stop"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "video_generation",
      "type": "iteration",
      "name": "视频生成",
      "position": {
        "x": 3900,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-video-artist",
        "arrayTemplate": "{{video_tasks.items}}",
        "userInputTemplate": "用户要求生成这个 shot_id 的最终视频。严格按单项参数实际调用 generate_video；有 image_url 时传入，禁止重复提交。流程已经进入轮询阶段：提交成功后调用 check_video_generation 一次并如实保留 pending/completed/failed 状态。不得编造 URL 或完成状态。\n【单项视频任务】\n{{__item__}}",
        "maxParallel": 1,
        "onError": "stop"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "video_qa",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "视频 QA",
      "position": {
        "x": 4120,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-qa-inspector",
        "userInputTemplate": "执行视频交付门禁：逐生成单元核对真实 jobId、状态、URL、时长和顺序。只有全部任务 completed 且有平台 /uploads/ URL 才可继续；然后必须实际调用 inspect_media，inspection_type=video，criteria 使用分镜和连续性标准，并将抽帧证据合并进 qa_report。pending/failed/缺失、inspect_media 未调用/失败/blocked 都必须 gate=FAIL；仅 qa_report.verdict=pass 时 gate=PASS。\n【分镜】\n{{storyboard.output}}\n【视频任务】\n{{video_generation.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"phase\",\"gate\",\"qa_report\"],\"properties\":{\"phase\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"VIDEO\"},\"gate\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"PASS\",\"FAIL\"]},\"qa_report\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scope\",\"evidence\",\"checks\",\"verdict\",\"blockers\",\"rework_tasks\",\"summary\"],\"properties\":{\"scope\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"text\",\"image\",\"video\",\"mixed\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"checks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"pass\",\"fail\",\"blocked\"]},\"passed_items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"blockers\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"rework_tasks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "video_gate",
      "type": "condition",
      "name": "视频门禁",
      "position": {
        "x": 4340,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "cases": [
          {
            "label": "PASS",
            "var": "{{video_qa.gate}}",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "PASS"
          }
        ],
        "elseLabel": "FAIL"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "end",
      "type": "end",
      "name": "生产交付",
      "position": {
        "x": 4580,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "outputTemplate": "# 漫剧生产结果\n\n## 规格门禁\n{{spec_qa.output}}\n\n## 图片门禁\n{{image_qa.output}}\n\n## 视频门禁\n{{video_qa.output}}\n\n## 图片资产\n{{image_package.output}}\n\n## 视频资产\n{{video_generation.output}}"
      }
    }
